{"id":"n21158-1-8","stage":2,"title":"불러일으키다 · 引起","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21158-1-8-1","ko":"승규랑 민준이, 왜 싸운 거야?","zh":"承奎和敏俊，为什么吵架啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규랑","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"승규랑","audio":"/audio/6fee231a092f9f8d9b8c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규랑","audio":"/audio/6fee231a092f9f8d9b8c.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이","audio":"/audio/32f61c157245f6426f6e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이","audio":"/audio/32f61c157245f6426f6e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"싸운","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸운","audio":"/audio/9555c84b343dcb78c2da.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/6e80e54281a6e7898f9a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21158-1-8-2","ko":"지수가 거짓말로 그 둘의 싸움을 불러일으켰어.","zh":"是智秀用谎言挑起了他们两人的争吵。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"거짓말로","meaning":"谎言","explanation":"거짓말：谎言；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"거짓말","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28444","senseId":"1","lemma":"거짓말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거짓말로","audio":"/audio/0c09f9c246229b35b7ac.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"둘의","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘의","audio":"/audio/46f92b3bff9a64b33fd6.mp3"}},{"text":"싸움을","meaning":"争斗，打架，战斗","explanation":"싸움：争斗，打架，战斗；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"싸움","audio":"/audio/4239ef3beaa33c340c05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24286","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸움을","audio":"/audio/12132ad39be374fb2915.mp3"}},{"text":"불러일으켰어.","meaning":"引起，惹起","explanation":"불러일으키다：引起，惹起；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"불러일으키다","audio":"/audio/c21cc2cc031b126a994a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21158","senseId":"1","lemma":"불러일으키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불러일으켰어","audio":"/audio/eabcf531c299578ce43a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a142bcee838500ea","term":"거짓말","zh":"谎言","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3","entryId":"28444","definition":"把非事实的事情编造成事实一样说的话。","pronunciation":["거ː진말"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"ca76b1284fc2088d","term":"둘","zh":"二","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3","entryId":"34869","definition":"一加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["둘ː"]},{"id":"4239ef3beaa33c34","term":"싸움","zh":"争斗，打架，战斗","audio":"/audio/4239ef3beaa33c340c05.mp3","entryId":"24286","definition":"为了战胜对方，凭借口舌、力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸움"]},{"id":"c21cc2cc031b126a","term":"불러일으키다","zh":"引起，惹起","audio":"/audio/c21cc2cc031b126a994a.mp3","entryId":"21158","definition":"引发某种情绪、行动、状态或事件。","pronunciation":["불러이르키다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c80e25c6d689c5423a1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.345,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=21158","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":78,"sequenceScore":2.1717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["承奎和敏俊，为什么吵架啊？","是智秀用谎言挑起了他们两人的争吵。","我觉得胸口闷，好像要吐了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎和敏俊，为什么吵架啊？","是智秀用谎言挑起了他们两人的争吵。","我觉得胸口闷，好像要吐了。"],"answer":1}]}
